{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大号白色粗体文字：“他心里还憋着一股气……竟又高兴了一小会儿。”位置靠上、字号最大、对比度高。随后下方另一块同样醒目的大号白字也会争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他仍憋着一股气，回想起从前被人当作自己人时，曾短暂地高兴了一下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴；随后心酸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"过去那种被接纳的日子已经无法恢复，以及离开以后是否真的会过得更好的不确定和疑虑。需要结合下方长句才能完整理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号白字都很显眼，争夺主视线，视觉入口不够集中。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块长句里：上方交代过去被当作自己人的经历和短暂高兴，下方才交代高兴转为心酸的原因及对离开后生活的疑虑，需要拼接才能理解完整关系。\",\n    \"两块主文都是包含多层意思的长句，不读到句子后半部分容易只抓到情绪片段。\",\n    \"中间连续四行小字堆叠了大量情绪、场景和心理词，需要在多条信息中筛选。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "97aa3c27-8409-4905-b003-5f7df0ba1263", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T033117474914Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:31:56.535217+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "05b80c5d072f40fd94afd63098f4391a58de65158702fde9aca14586abcb8d20", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\c